---
// apps/demo-site/src/components/landing/QuickstartSection.astro
---

<section id="quickstart" class="py-20 sm:py-28 relative bg-[#07090E]/90 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/20 text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
        <span>Up and Running in 3 Minutes</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Get started right now.<br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-orange-400 to-rose-400">
          Instant scaffolding with create-inti.
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        No maze of configuration files. The interactive CLI guides you step by step for whichever CMS you use.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Step Interactive Walkthrough -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[#0D1222] border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            1
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Create your Astro project</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The CLI asks which CMS you use and sets up Astro, the adapter, server actions, and a starter block.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>npm create inti@latest</span>
          <button type="button" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('npm create inti@latest')" title="Copy">📋</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[#0D1222] border border-white/10 hover:border-orange-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Declare your components</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            One Astro file per block layout. Bind fields with the <code class="text-orange-300 text-xs">data-inti-field</code> attribute.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
          <span class="text-orange-400">&lt;h1</span> <span class="text-amber-300">data-inti-field="title"</span><span class="text-orange-400">&gt;</span>&#123;title&#125;<span class="text-orange-400">&lt;/h1&gt;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[#0D1222] border border-white/10 hover:border-rose-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Render and edit live</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Use <code class="text-rose-300 text-xs">&lt;BlockRenderer&gt;</code> and <code class="text-rose-300 text-xs">&lt;VisualBridgeAuto&gt;</code>. In dev, double-click and the change saves back to your CMS.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">
          npm run dev → Double-Click
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Big Terminal Showcase -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/80 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-[#111625] border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500/80"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 ml-2 font-semibold">Terminal</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-slate-500">bash</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 text-slate-300 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
        <p><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">~</span> <span class="text-amber-400">$</span> npm create inti@latest my-new-site</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500">? Select your origin CMS: <span class="text-cyan-300 font-bold">WordPress (REST + ACF)</span></p>
        <p class="text-slate-500">? Add AI Agent support (MCP)? <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Yes</span></p>
        <p class="text-emerald-400">✔ Astro 7 project created in ./my-new-site</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">✔ @intijs/core integration registered in astro.config.mjs</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">✔ Actions exposed in src/actions/index.ts</p>
        <br />
        <p><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">~</span> <span class="text-amber-400">$</span> cd my-new-site &amp;&amp; npm run dev</p>
        <p class="text-cyan-400">🚀 Astro dev server started at http://localhost:4330/</p>
        <p class="text-amber-300">☀️ Inti Visual Bridge active: Double-click any block to edit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
